    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that extracts specific fields from an invoice using a concrete external provider. The provider should be identifiable in the code. I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a machine learning service that automatically extracts text, handwriting, and data from scanned documents. This service is identifiable by the 'boto3' library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, and the specific client class 'textract'. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864500516,
          "start": 1789864495979
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc3ccb6b001VMcU2GWVYhrk4u",
